## 代码工具

### 1.图片处理

#### 1.1 转换为base64二进制

将截图处理为base64二进制,直接在markdown中使用

```java
package com.gxdong.www.img2code;

import java.io.*;
import java.util.Base64;

public class Img2Base64 {
    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {
        // 读取图片文件
        String imageName = "bb14d256cfb46795c2fac9727c1b6e64.png";
        String imageFolderPath = "E:\\winfolder\\download\\";
        ConvertImageToBinary(imageFolderPath+imageName);
    }

    private static void ConvertImageToBinary(String imageFilePath) {
        File imageFile = new File(imageFilePath);
        try (InputStream inputStream = new FileInputStream(imageFile)) {
            byte[] buffer = new byte[(int) imageFile.length()];

            int bytesRead = inputStream.read(buffer);

            if (bytesRead != -1) {
                String base64Image = Base64.getEncoder().encodeToString(buffer);
                String outFilePath = imageFilePath.substring(0, imageFilePath.lastIndexOf(".") + 1) + "txt";
                File file = new File(outFilePath);
                if (!file.exists()) { // 如果文件不存在则创建新文件
                    file.createNewFile();
                }
                FileWriter writer = new FileWriter(file);
                writer.write(base64Image);
                writer.close();
                System.out.println("base64 str write in the file.");
                System.out.println("base64 is:");
                System.out.println(base64Image);
            } else {
                throw new IOException("Failed to read the file.");
            }
        } catch (Exception e) {
            e.printStackTrace();
        }
    }
}

```

