## 数据结构

### 1. set集合的实现

创建helloset.html

```
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Hello Set</title>

</head>
<body>
<input type="button" value="执行" onclick="hellosettest()">
</body>
<script src="../js/helloset.js"></script>
